Dialogue: 9,0:00:04.80,0:00:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hava çok güzel.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:08.24,0:00:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,O zaman, gezmeye çıkalım.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:10.24,0:00:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ne?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:10.48,0:00:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nereye gideceğiz?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:17.24,0:00:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Acaba nereye gitmeye çalışıyor?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:19.79,0:00:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Özel bir yere gidiyordur belki!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:30.01,0:00:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Cidden bir şey var.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:32.22,0:00:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Çok heyecanlandım!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:37.17,0:00:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Vay, deniz!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:39.93,0:00:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Demek hedefimiz burasıydı !
Dialogue: 9,0:00:44.41,0:00:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ne?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:44.79,0:00:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirotan?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:49.42,0:00:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamamdır, ilerlemeye devam edelim.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:52.87,0:00:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hedefimiz burası değil miydi?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:55.61,0:00:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Macera devam ediyor.
